---
title: AdviseCare - Sequence Diagram SD-35 - Read Notifications
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User
    participant W as Web App
    participant C as NotificationsController
    participant S as NotificationService
    participant R as IGenericRepository
    participant DB as SQL Server
    W->>C: GET /api/Notifications/me/unread-count
    C->>S: GetMyUnreadCountAsync(AccountId)
    S-->>W: count for the badge
    U->>W: Open the notification list
    W->>C: GET /api/Notifications/me
    C->>S: GetMyNotificationsAsync(AccountId)
    S->>R: Own notifications, newest first
    U->>W: Click a notification
    W->>C: PUT /api/Notifications/me/{id}/read
    C->>S: MarkAsReadAsync(AccountId, NotificationId)
    S->>R: UpdateAsync(isRead = true)
    R->>DB: UPDATE NOTIFICATIONS
    W-->>U: Navigate to redirectUrl (e.g. /cases/{caseId})
    U->>W: "Clear read notifications"
    W->>C: DELETE /api/Notifications/me/clear
    C->>S: ClearMyReadNotificationsAsync(AccountId)
    S->>R: Remove read notifications
    R->>DB: DELETE NOTIFICATIONS
